{"seq":3,"slug":"dds-amendment-rejection-archive","title":"声明变更、驳回重提与存档留存合规运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/due-diligence-statement-submission-system/dds-amendment-rejection-archive","wordCount":2812,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"声明变更-驳回重提与存档留存合规运营\">声明变更、驳回重提与存档留存合规运营</h1><p>一份 DDS 提交成功、拿到参考号之后，运营团队最常问的第一个问题往往是&quot;写错了能不能改&quot;。这个问题的答案决定了整个提交系统的数据架构：<strong>已提交并获得参考号的声明不能就地编辑</strong>。欧盟信息系统把提交动作视为一次产生法律效力的事件——页面明确说明，提交后的声明与简化声明&quot;具有法律价值，其内容可被主管机关核查&quot;（来源：<a href=\"https://green-forum.ec.europa.eu/deforestation-regulation-implementation/information-system_en\">European Commission, EUDR Information System</a>）。因此&quot;变更&quot;&quot;驳回&quot;&quot;存档&quot;三条运营链路，本质上都是围绕<strong>不可变声明对象</strong>展开的：变更靠新建，驳回靠重提，存档靠冻结。本文承接<a href=\"dds-statement-data-model\">声明数据模型</a>定义的对象结构，把这三条链路的系统设计与合规后果讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-dds-是-append-only-文档\">核心概念：为什么 DDS 是 append-only 文档</h2><p>把 DDS 建成可编辑表单，是这套系统第一类设计错误。法律义务的时点是&quot;投放市场或出口<strong>之前</strong>提交&quot;（条例 (EU) 2023/1115 第 4 条第 2 款），参考号是这次提交的事实记录，它被下游经营者用来免除重复尽调（第 4 条第 4、5 款），被海关用来放行（第 31 条）。如果同一参考号背后的内容可以被事后改写，那么下游引用、海关放行、主管机关核查三者在时间上就失去了共同的事实基础。</p>\n<p>系统的正确姿态是<strong>每次提交冻结一版载荷（payload）</strong>，编号与内容永久绑定。这条约束带来一个直接推论：所谓&quot;修改声明&quot;，在系统里从来不表现为 <code>UPDATE</code>，而表现为一次新的 <code>INSERT</code>——新声明有自己的参考号，旧声明保持原样，两者通过显式的引用字段建立&quot;替代/补充&quot;关系。审计时看到的是一条声明链，而不是一份被覆盖的文档。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>工程上把&quot;变更&quot;翻译成&quot;新建 + 建立替代关系&quot;，是让合规可举证的关键。就地覆盖会让系统失去&quot;当时提交了什么&quot;的答案，而这恰恰是核查时要问的第一个问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"变更的三种合法形态\">变更的三种合法形态</h2><p>运营中会出现三类变更诉求，它们的正确解法各不相同，混用会制造数量与引用上的不一致：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更诉求</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>系统动作</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容更正（笔误、单位填错）</td>\n<td>提交后发现字段错误</td>\n<td>用仪表盘 <code>Copy as new</code> 复制为新声明，修正后提交</td>\n<td>新声明须显式指向被更正的原参考号，原声明保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链事实变更（新增地块/换供应商）</td>\n<td>上游货源变化</td>\n<td>生成新声明，覆盖增量货量</td>\n<td>不得修改已提交声明的商品行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量增量（同一批货分批投放）</td>\n<td>一次尽调覆盖多批出货</td>\n<td>累计多份声明覆盖同一批货</td>\n<td>累计量须与实际投放量勾稽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <code>Copy as new</code> 是信息系统仪表盘提供的原生功能，训练视频标题即为&quot;Retrieval of DDS and &#39;Copy as new&#39; function&quot;（来源：同上 EUDR Information System 官方页）。它把一份已提交声明的全部字段复制成一份新的草稿，运营人员只改需要改的部分，从而避免重新录入。</p>\n<p>数量增量这一形态需要一条硬校验。若某批货实际投放量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>placed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{placed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">placed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份声明分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 累计覆盖，则合规区间是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>placed</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>placed</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{placed}} \\le \\sum_{i=1}^{n} q_i \\le Q_{\\text{placed}} \\cdot (1 + \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">placed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">placed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的超声明容差。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 0 会因四舍五入导致报关卡壳，取过大则触发&quot;数量合理性&quot;质疑；把它作为<strong>显式配置项</strong>而非硬编码常量，是按商品类别（可可按袋、木材按板英尺）调节的关键。欠声明在报关环节直接失败，超声明在主管机关复核时被追问，两端都是运营事件而非技术异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"驳回与重提-核查触发的状态机\">驳回与重提：核查触发的状态机</h2><p>主管机关依据条例第 16 至 18 条对声明开展核查，可要求补充资料、启动现场检查，后果覆盖从要求整改到禁止投放。系统层面，一条声明在被核查后可能进入&quot;被驳回/被质疑&quot;状态。<strong>驳回不是删除</strong>：参考号仍然存在，只是其对应的合规主张被否定。运营团队要做的是定位驳回根因、修数据、重提一份能独立成立的新声明。</p>\n<p>驳回的常见根因可以归纳为四类，每类对应不同的修复路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[已提交 DDS&lt;br/&gt;status: submitted / valid] --&gt; C{主管机关核查&lt;br/&gt;Art. 16-18}&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| K[状态保持有效&lt;br/&gt;供下游引用]&#10;  C --&gt;|要求补正| R1[驳回/待整改&lt;br/&gt;rejected / queried]&#10;  C --&gt;|禁止投放| R2[不通过&lt;br/&gt;配合后续处置]&#10;  R1 --&gt; D1{根因定位}&#10;  D1 --&gt;|地理定位缺失或不自洽| F1[补齐地块几何&lt;br/&gt;重新生成声明]&#10;  D1 --&gt;|数量口径不一致| F2[用主数据重算量纲&lt;br/&gt;修正累计覆盖]&#10;  D1 --&gt;|上游参考号失效| F3[要求上游重提&lt;br/&gt;再建立引用]&#10;  D1 --&gt;|风险结论无举证| F4[补尽调证据链&lt;br/&gt;重判可忽略风险]&#10;  F1 --&gt; N[Copy as new&lt;br/&gt;生成新声明并提交]&#10;  F2 --&gt; N&#10;  F3 --&gt; N&#10;  F4 --&gt; N&#10;  N --&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n  S[已提交 DDS&lt;br/&gt;status: submitted / valid] --&gt; C{主管机关核查&lt;br/&gt;Art. 16-18}\n  C --&gt;|通过| K[状态保持有效&lt;br/&gt;供下游引用]\n  C --&gt;|要求补正| R1[驳回/待整改&lt;br/&gt;rejected / queried]\n  C --&gt;|禁止投放| R2[不通过&lt;br/&gt;配合后续处置]\n  R1 --&gt; D1{根因定位}\n  D1 --&gt;|地理定位缺失或不自洽| F1[补齐地块几何&lt;br/&gt;重新生成声明]\n  D1 --&gt;|数量口径不一致| F2[用主数据重算量纲&lt;br/&gt;修正累计覆盖]\n  D1 --&gt;|上游参考号失效| F3[要求上游重提&lt;br/&gt;再建立引用]\n  D1 --&gt;|风险结论无举证| F4[补尽调证据链&lt;br/&gt;重判可忽略风险]\n  F1 --&gt; N[Copy as new&lt;br/&gt;生成新声明并提交]\n  F2 --&gt; N\n  F3 --&gt; N\n  F4 --&gt; N\n  N --&gt; S</pre><p>四条修复路径里，&quot;上游参考号失效&quot;最容易被低估。下游经营者引用上游 DDS 的参考号是条例赋予的便利（第 4 条第 4 款），但便利的前提是那个参考号仍然有效。如果上游的声明被驳回或被撤回，引用它就等于把风险直接承接过来。因此系统必须维护一条<strong>引用可用性检查</strong>：在下游声明提交前回查上游参考号的状态，一旦失效就要求上游先重提，再重建引用。这与<a href=\"dds-submission-reference-integration\">提交与参考号对接流程</a>中描述的引用机制是同一枚硬币的两面。</p>\n<p>重提还有一条常被忽略的时间约束。由于义务时点是&quot;投放前提交&quot;，驳回后的重提<strong>不能晚于实际投放</strong>，否则该批货在驳回窗口内处于无有效声明的状态，本身即构成违规。运营上应把&quot;驳回后重提&quot;纳入一个以小时计的 SLA，而不是按周处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"存档留存-5-年窗口-worm-存储与链式校验\">存档留存：5 年窗口、WORM 存储与链式校验</h2><p>条例第 12 条要求经营者与贸易商保存尽职调查记录与声明副本至少 <strong>5 年</strong>（与<a href=\"../eudr-regime-legal-model/eudr-scope-commodity-operator-obligations\">适用商品与经营者义务</a>中的保存义务一致）。这条要求在工程上翻译成三个具体问题：存什么、怎么存、怎么证明没被改。</p>\n<p><strong>存什么</strong>——不是只存参考号，而是声明载荷的完整快照，加上提交回执、系统状态历史、以及支撑风险结论的证据引用。参考号本身只是索引，5 年窗口内任何一次稽查都可能要求重建当时的事实。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么存</strong>——归档层必须是**一次写入、多次读取（WORM）**语义。声明一经提交，其归档副本不得被覆盖或删除；业务库里可以有工作副本，但归档副本是法律事实。对象存储的合规保留策略（如对象锁定）比数据库行级更新更适合承载这一语义，因为它在存储层而非应用层阻止篡改。</p>\n<p><strong>怎么证明没被改</strong>——用哈希链把相邻的归档版本串起来。对第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 版声明内容计算摘要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并把前一版摘要纳入本次计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>payload</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i = H\\big(h_{i-1} \\,\\|\\, \\text{payload}_i\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payload</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要任一历史版本被篡改，其后所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都会失配，校验函数即可定位到最早的破坏点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>verify</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>payload</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{verify}(k) = \\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k} \\Big[ H\\big(h_{i-1} \\,\\|\\, \\text{payload}_i\\big) = h_i \\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">verify</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payload</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>值得注意的是，哈希链在这里的价值<strong>不是</strong>防止外部攻击，而是让&quot;我们交的就是当时的原文&quot;这件事在内部可自证。它属于审计能力，而非安全边界；把它当成防篡改的安全控制会误判威胁模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归档维度</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保留期</td>\n<td>自提交/义务发生起 ≥5 年</td>\n<td>只保留当前有效声明，历史版本被清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可变性</td>\n<td>WORM，禁止覆盖与删除</td>\n<td>用可写数据库行承载归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>哈希链或等价校验机制</td>\n<td>无校验，无法证明未被改动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可检索性</td>\n<td>按参考号、EORI、日期、商品可查</td>\n<td>只按内部 ID 索引，稽查时找不到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律保留</td>\n<td>涉争议的声明加 hold，不受常规清理影响</td>\n<td>自动清理任务误删争议对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条&quot;法律保留&quot;常被自动化清理任务破坏。归档策略里必须有一条<strong>例外通道</strong>：被核查、被驳回、涉争议的声明进入法律保留状态，无论其保留期算法如何，清理任务都不得触碰。这是把合规判断写进生命周期，而不是事后补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营落地-状态机-指标与演练\">运营落地：状态机、指标与演练</h2><p>把上述三条链路合成一个可运营的系统，核心是把 DDS 建成显式状态机，而不是一组布尔标志位。状态至少包括：草稿、已提交、有效、被质疑、被驳回、已替代、已归档。合法转移是有限集合——&quot;已替代&quot;只能由新声明的建立触发，&quot;被驳回&quot;只能由核查结果触发——所有其他跳转都应在应用层被拒绝。</p>\n<p>配套需要三类运营指标：<strong>驳回率</strong>（按根因分类，用于改进上游数据质量）、<strong>驳回后重提时长</strong>（SLA 度量，直接关联违规窗口）、<strong>归档校验通过率</strong>（哈希链健康度）。这三类指标共同回答&quot;我们的声明在核查下扛不扛得住&quot;这一唯一有意义的问题。</p>\n<p>这套机制的价值最终由一次演练检验：随机抽取一条 5 年前归档的声明，在只允许使用归档层的情况下，能否在无网络访问业务库的条件下重建其完整内容并证明未被改动。能通过，说明归档是真的；通不过，说明存在一条隐藏的实时依赖——而这条依赖在稽查当天会以&quot;查不到&quot;的形式暴露。</p>\n<p>一次合格的演练至少覆盖三个动作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冷重建</strong>：断开业务库与在线服务，仅用归档副本还原一条历史声明的完整载荷与提交回执。</li>\n<li><strong>完整性校验</strong>：对还原出的声明重算哈希链，确认与归档时记录的摘要一致，且能定位任何最早的破坏点。</li>\n<li><strong>法律保留验证</strong>：确认处于法律保留（hold）状态的声明未被任何自动清理任务触碰，保留期算法对其不生效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结-三条不可协商的设计约束\">小结：三条不可协商的设计约束</h2><p>声明生命周期的设计原则可以归纳为一句：<strong>变更即新建，驳回即重提，归档即冻结</strong>。这三条不是流程偏好，而是由&quot;提交后不可就地改写&quot;这一硬约束推导出的必然结果，也是这套系统区别于普通表单系统的根本所在。落地时，把 DDS 建成显式状态机、把变更翻译成带替代引用的新提交、把归档放在 WORM 层并加哈希链校验，三者共同支撑起 5 年留存窗口内任意一次稽查的可举证能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"声明变更、驳回重提与存档留存合规运营","id":"声明变更-驳回重提与存档留存合规运营"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么 DDS 是 append-only 文档","id":"核心概念-为什么-dds-是-append-only-文档"},{"level":2,"text":"变更的三种合法形态","id":"变更的三种合法形态"},{"level":2,"text":"驳回与重提：核查触发的状态机","id":"驳回与重提-核查触发的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"存档留存：5 年窗口、WORM 存储与链式校验","id":"存档留存-5-年窗口-worm-存储与链式校验"},{"level":2,"text":"运营落地：状态机、指标与演练","id":"运营落地-状态机-指标与演练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：三条不可协商的设计约束","id":"小结-三条不可协商的设计约束"}],"prev":{"title":"DDS 提交、参考号生成与欧盟信息系统对接流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/due-diligence-statement-submission-system/dds-submission-reference-integration"},"next":{"title":"国别与商品风险分级模型及简化尽职调查适用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/commodity-risk-assessment-operations/country-commodity-risk-benchmark"}}